\ Interpreter-free AOT dispatch through `case`. The branch quotations are buried
\ in a composite `{ ... }` literal, discovered and code_ptr-attached by the freeze
\ pass; the compiled `case` selects a branch at runtime and calls its quotation
\ directly via the attached code_ptr. The former strict-mode rejection of this
\ dynamic call is lifted: a null code_ptr traps cleanly, so the runtime-depth
\ row-rebase dispatch runs interpreter-free. Output matches the interpreter.
2 { { 1 [ 100 ] } { 2 [ 200 ] } { 3 [ 300 ] } } case .
9 { { 1 [ 100 ] } [ 999 ] } case .
